WEBVTT

00:16:55.146 --> 00:17:00.762
I said, "I know all that -- what day is it?"

00:17:00.762 --> 00:17:07.786
You see, I knew that the car had gone over the guardrail on the 28th of February,

00:17:07.786 --> 00:17:11.435
and I knew that 1976 was a leap year.

00:17:11.435 --> 00:17:16.145
"Nurse! Is this the 28th or the 29th?"

00:17:16.145 --> 00:17:18.138
And she looked at me and said,

00:17:18.138 --> 00:17:20.713
"It's March 1st."

00:17:20.713 --> 00:17:23.194
And I went, "Oh my God.

00:17:23.194 --> 00:17:25.730
I've got some catching up to do!"

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:28.402
And from that moment, I knew

00:17:28.402 --> 00:17:31.650
the given was that accident;